/*
  The keywords of nft's text lexer (src/scanner.l), which it reads as a
  keyword, never as a name, where the text renderer writes a name: a set
  named `counter` fails to parse in `add set ip t counter`, quoted or not.
  `global` holds the keywords of every scanner state; each other list the
  keywords of the state a name follows, such as `counter` after the
  `counter` keyword. Each list is the union of the tested nftables
  releases' keywords, 1.1.6 and 1.1.7, so a keyword one release adds is
  refused on both. integration-nftables-enum-extraction fails when the
  package set's lexer holds a keyword a list lacks.
*/
